# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Digital Typewriter — an AI Writers Retreat open source writing tool
#
# Every value here is optional. With none of them set the app runs fully
# offline, stores your writing only in this browser, and makes no third-party
# requests.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Google OAuth client ID, used only for "Save to Google Drive".
# Create a Web application client in the Google Cloud console, enable the
# Drive API, and add your origin to its authorised JavaScript origins.
# Leave empty to hide the Drive button entirely. See README.md.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=""

# Google Analytics 4 measurement ID, e.g. G-XXXXXXXXXX.
# Leave empty and no analytics script is loaded.
VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=""
